a beanbag chair


00:38:06.208 --> 00:38:07.514
and some comic books.


00:38:09.037 --> 00:38:10.256
What happened here?


00:38:10.952 --> 00:38:12.127
[hard grunt]


00:38:12.302 --> 00:38:14.434
I'’m tired
of giving you warnings!


00:38:15.305 --> 00:38:17.307
[grunts, yells]


00:38:18.308 --> 00:38:19.700
Where'’d you go, hedgehog?


00:38:19.874 --> 00:38:21.746
I wasn'’t finished
trauma dumping.


00:38:23.574 --> 00:38:26.359
My darlings!


00:38:26.533 --> 00:38:28.056
[inhales, giggles]


00:38:28.230 --> 00:38:30.668
My eggy weggies!


00:38:31.799 --> 00:38:34.846
[professor] ♪ <i>Memories</i>♪


00:38:35.020 --> 00:38:38.371
♪ <i>Light the corners</i>♪


00:38:38.545 --> 00:38:42.201
♪ <i>Of my mind</i>♪


00:38:42.375 --> 00:38:45.509
♪ <i>Misty watercolor</i>♪


00:38:45.683 --> 00:38:51.297
♪ <i>Memories</i>♪


00:38:51.471 --> 00:38:54.344
♪ <i>Of the way</i>♪


00:38:54.518 --> 00:38:59.784
♪ <i>We weren'’t</i>♪


00:39:00.741 --> 00:39:01.742
I...


00:39:03.483 --> 00:39:05.224
don'’t believe it.Don'’t you?


00:39:05.398 --> 00:39:06.660
It'’s impossible.Is it?


00:39:06.834 --> 00:39:07.748
It couldn'’t be.Couldn'’t it?


00:39:07.922 --> 00:39:08.706
I'’m--Are you?


00:39:08.880 --> 00:39:10.055
Imposter!


00:39:10.229 --> 00:39:12.492
You stole my babies!


00:39:12.666 --> 00:39:15.843
But they know
who their real daddy is...


00:39:16.017 --> 00:39:17.105
drone-napper!


00:39:17.279 --> 00:39:18.803
[chortling]


00:39:18.977 --> 00:39:22.067
Magnificent creations,
my boy.


00:39:22.241 --> 00:39:24.809
I borrowed them
to lure you here


00:39:24.983 --> 00:39:26.985
and reunite our family.


00:39:28.726 --> 00:39:30.380
You see, Ivo...


00:39:32.512 --> 00:39:35.515
I'’m your grandfather:


00:39:35.689 --> 00:39:38.126
Gerald Robotnik.


00:39:42.174 --> 00:39:44.872
