00:39:46.613 --> 00:39:49.486
But how? And why?


00:39:50.269 --> 00:39:52.314
And who did what with whom?


00:39:52.489 --> 00:39:57.407
You hail from an ancestry
of excellence...


00:39:57.581 --> 00:40:00.148
