00:40:00.322 --> 00:40:03.238
Yes, I know French.


00:40:05.763 --> 00:40:07.286
You do look like me.


00:40:08.243 --> 00:40:10.202
But fatter. And older.


00:40:11.072 --> 00:40:13.031
And there'’s that funny smell.


00:40:14.728 --> 00:40:17.557
But the resemblance
is uncanny.


00:40:18.428 --> 00:40:20.038
It'’s as if...


00:40:20.212 --> 00:40:22.301
[both]
...we'’re two characters in a movie


00:40:22.475 --> 00:40:25.043
