by the same actor.


00:40:25.217 --> 00:40:27.654
But I need real proof!Ivo!


00:40:27.828 --> 00:40:29.134
We have very little time.


00:40:30.657 --> 00:40:32.790
But I could field
a couple of queries.


00:40:32.964 --> 00:40:36.097
Name the most elegant formula
in mathematics.


00:40:36.271 --> 00:40:37.621
Euler'’s Identity.


00:40:37.795 --> 00:40:40.101
E to the I times pi plus one
equals zilch.


00:40:40.275 --> 00:40:42.103
European capitals
arranged alphabetically


00:40:42.277 --> 00:40:43.540
by the fourth letter.


00:40:43.714 --> 00:40:45.455
Riga, Monaco, Sarajevo, Tirana.


00:40:45.629 --> 00:40:47.413
The speed of light
divided by the speed of sound,


00:40:47.587 --> 00:40:49.633
divided by
the speed of the bus in the movie <i>Speed.</i>


00:40:49.807 --> 00:40:51.156
[mimics adding machine]


00:40:51.330 --> 00:40:53.898
17,893.33333...


00:40:54.072 --> 00:40:57.510
Rounding up?17,894 MPH.


00:40:57.684 --> 00:41:00.165
And, for all the marbles...


00:41:00.339 --> 00:41:02.515
Good. I lost mine.


00:41:02.689 --> 00:41:04.735
A rare lung disease,


00:41:04.909 --> 00:41:07.999
and the longest word
in the English dictionary.


00:41:08.652 --> 00:41:10.131
Um...


00:41:10.305 --> 00:41:13.613
[both] Pneumonoultramicroscopic-
silicovolcanoconiosis!


00:41:14.484 --> 00:41:18.139
Pap-pap!In the saggy flesh.


00:41:18.313 --> 00:41:20.402
