00:41:22.840 --> 00:41:25.451
Oh, Grampy-poo! [laughs]


00:41:28.846 --> 00:41:32.632
Where have you been
my entire life?


00:41:32.806 --> 00:41:34.373
[moans happily]


00:41:34.547 --> 00:41:36.549
