00:42:19.461 --> 00:42:21.855
[groaning]


00:42:24.858 --> 00:42:26.817
Oh, no. Oh, no, no.


00:42:26.991 --> 00:42:28.819
Someone tell me
this is some kind of


00:42:28.993 --> 00:42:31.125
