exposition!


00:43:02.374 --> 00:43:04.463
Shadow, get the key.


00:43:04.637 --> 00:43:05.638
Where is it?


00:43:05.812 --> 00:43:07.901
Ha! Good one, Hot Topic.


00:43:08.075 --> 00:43:10.164
Do you really think
we'’d be that stupid


00:43:10.338 --> 00:43:12.384
