<i>the most powerful weapon</i>


00:43:33.144 --> 00:43:35.668
<i>mankind has ever seen,</i>


00:43:35.842 --> 00:43:38.410
<i>capable of delivering</i>
<i>a precision strike</i>


00:43:38.584 --> 00:43:39.977
<i>anywhere on Earth.</i>


00:43:41.413 --> 00:43:42.632
<i>Our first target:</i>


00:43:43.458 --> 00:43:45.112
<i>GUN Headquarters.</i>


00:43:45.286 --> 00:43:47.419
But firing a weapon
that powerful


00:43:47.593 --> 00:43:49.551
