of innocent lives!


00:43:49.726 --> 00:43:51.989
Yeah, tera-bite me.[cackles]


00:43:52.163 --> 00:43:57.037
This is one of two keys required
to launch the Eclipse Cannon.


00:43:57.211 --> 00:43:59.518
The other is locked
inside GUN headquarters.


00:43:59.692 --> 00:44:01.563
Once we have both,


00:44:01.738 --> 00:44:04.566
I will take rightful control
of my weapon.


00:44:04.741 --> 00:44:06.525
I'’m in.


00:44:13.488 --> 00:44:14.968
Holy crab!


00:44:15.142 --> 00:44:16.753
