this little adventure.


00:44:20.844 --> 00:44:23.020
It really worked out
for me.


00:44:23.194 --> 00:44:26.153
And you wonder why
I have trust issues!


00:44:27.633 --> 00:44:29.809
Shadow, wait! Don'’t do this.


00:44:29.983 --> 00:44:31.376
I know you'’re hurting,


00:44:31.550 --> 00:44:34.074
