00:45:24.734 --> 00:45:25.952
[grunts]


00:45:28.259 --> 00:45:29.739
Come on.


00:45:31.001 --> 00:45:32.567
Come on.


00:45:32.742 --> 00:45:34.395
Come on.[Knuckles groans]


00:45:36.006 --> 00:45:37.703
[both] Come on!


00:45:38.443 --> 00:45:39.357
[yells]


00:45:39.531 --> 00:45:41.707
[all yelling]


00:45:47.104 --> 00:45:49.628
Yeah! Yes!


00:45:53.327 --> 00:45:54.328
[Sonic] Yikes.


00:45:55.634 --> 00:45:57.418
Somebody better call
Google Maps.


00:45:58.593 --> 00:46:01.161
[rumbling faintly]


00:46:01.335 --> 00:46:05.470
I'’ve spent years
trying to cleanse the cosmos


00:46:05.644 --> 00:46:09.300
