00:46:18.744 --> 00:46:21.616
Charting route to GUN
Headquarters in London, sirs.


00:46:21.791 --> 00:46:23.880
ETA four hours.


00:46:24.054 --> 00:46:25.359
As the crab flies.


00:46:25.533 --> 00:46:27.884
By all accounts,
we'’re ahead of schedule.


00:46:28.841 --> 00:46:30.756
We should take this time


00:46:30.930 --> 00:46:32.932
