00:48:16.514 --> 00:48:17.994
[song ends]


00:48:27.525 --> 00:48:28.961
And done!


00:48:29.135 --> 00:48:31.877
Masterpiece.
Look at that.Yay!


00:48:32.051 --> 00:48:35.489
It'’s really been great
having time to ourselves.


00:48:35.663 --> 00:48:38.101
Right. Absolutely.
I just feel so...


00:48:38.275 --> 00:48:39.667
