Clearheaded.


00:48:39.841 --> 00:48:42.148
Mmm, look at all these
new interests we found.


00:48:42.322 --> 00:48:44.324
I know, so many hobbies.So many!


00:48:44.498 --> 00:48:47.327
After the action and adventure
of the last few years,


00:48:47.501 --> 00:48:49.721
well, I could get used to this.Same.


00:48:49.895 --> 00:48:51.897
[deep rumbling]


00:48:55.466 --> 00:48:57.816
[Sonic] Tom! Maddie!
We need your help on a super--


00:48:57.990 --> 00:49:00.819
Knuckles, do you mind?Oh! Excuse me.


00:49:00.993 --> 00:49:02.429
Tom! Maddie! We need your help


00:49:02.603 --> 00:49:04.127
