top-secret mission!


00:49:04.301 --> 00:49:05.345
Hmm.


00:49:07.086 --> 00:49:08.740
Thank God. Yeah, we'’re in.Let'’s go.


00:49:08.914 --> 00:49:11.134
Really? You'’re in?
Just like that?


00:49:11.308 --> 00:49:14.050
Yes. It was getting so boring
without you guys here.Yeah. So...


00:49:14.224 --> 00:49:15.877
No offense....boring. No, none taken.


00:49:16.052 --> 00:49:17.531
I mean, whatever crazy plan
you'’re cooking up,


00:49:17.705 --> 00:49:19.011
the answer'’s yes.Yes.


00:49:19.185 --> 00:49:22.145
Great. But first things first:
What is that?


00:49:22.319 --> 00:49:23.798
Oh! This is...


00:49:23.973 --> 00:49:25.409
[in puppet voice]
...Li'’l Tom!


00:49:25.583 --> 00:49:27.063
