Isn'’t he great?


00:49:28.629 --> 00:49:30.849
I told you
to get rid of that. It'’s very creepy.


00:49:31.023 --> 00:49:32.198
[puppet voice]
I told him to get rid of you.


00:49:32.372 --> 00:49:33.765
