Whoa!


01:02:48.689 --> 01:02:50.691
My feet. Why can'’t I
use my beautiful feet?


01:02:50.866 --> 01:02:52.345
Heh-heh![Rockwell] Because...


01:02:52.519 --> 01:02:55.566
this vault is armed
with variable gravity.


01:02:55.740 --> 01:02:56.959
[straining]


01:02:57.133 --> 01:02:57.960
No kidding.


01:02:58.134 --> 01:02:59.918
[Rockwell] Green goes up...


01:03:00.092 --> 01:03:02.268
and red takes you down... hard.


01:03:02.442 --> 01:03:03.617
Rockwell, listen to me.


01:03:03.792 --> 01:03:05.576
The Robotniks are planning to--
[yelps]


01:03:05.750 --> 01:03:07.665
Oh, they'’re planning on stealing
a second key, just like you are?


01:03:07.839 --> 01:03:09.232
Yes, I'’m aware.


01:03:10.755 --> 01:03:13.279
I called it
the second Commander Walters was attacked.


01:03:13.453 --> 01:03:14.933
So...


01:03:15.107 --> 01:03:17.675
thank you
for taking the bait


01:03:17.849 --> 01:03:19.329
and falling
right into my trap.


01:03:19.503 --> 01:03:21.635
I don'’t believe this.


01:03:21.810 --> 01:03:23.420
[Gerald]
I know, grandson.


01:03:23.594 --> 01:03:25.596
A woman in the military!


01:03:27.511 --> 01:03:28.947
Let'’s go.


01:03:30.035 --> 01:03:31.254
Go, positions!


01:03:31.428 --> 01:03:32.516
Full perimeter.


01:03:32.690 --> 01:03:33.909
[weapons powering up]


01:03:34.083 --> 01:03:35.388
Robotnik.


01:03:35.562 --> 01:03:37.826
Going full spandex, huh?
Who'’s the fossil?


01:03:38.000 --> 01:03:42.134
That'’s my grandfather,
you dough-eating dimbecile.


01:03:42.308 --> 01:03:45.398
Who are they?A couple of bleeding hearts,


01:03:45.572 --> 01:03:48.401
here to rescue
their emotional-support animals.


01:03:48.575 --> 01:03:50.360
Enough! It'’s over.


01:03:50.534 --> 01:03:54.103
The only way
you'’re leaving here is in handcuffs.


01:03:54.277 --> 01:03:55.974
There is no other way out.


01:03:56.148 --> 01:03:58.934
You know, there might be
one other way out.


01:03:59.108 --> 01:04:00.500
And what is that
supposed to mean?


01:04:00.674 --> 01:04:02.589
[Sonic] Hey, big guy,
I think it'’s time to...


01:04:03.764 --> 01:04:07.072
Break glass
in case of emergency!


01:04:09.031 --> 01:04:11.076
[roaring]


01:04:11.947 --> 01:04:13.209
[grunts]


01:04:14.210 --> 01:04:17.256
Ha! Nothing can stop
Team Knuckles!


01:04:17.430 --> 01:04:18.518
Open fire!


01:04:19.519 --> 01:04:21.391
[yelps] Knuckles,
turn this stuff off!


01:04:21.565 --> 01:04:22.871
Hurry!On it.


01:04:24.481 --> 01:04:25.569
Uh-oh.


01:04:25.743 --> 01:04:27.701
[all yelling in surprise]


01:04:27.876 --> 01:04:29.878
[grunting]


01:04:33.185 --> 01:04:35.535
Ha! See how you like it--
[groans]


01:04:35.709 --> 01:04:37.711
[yelping]


01:04:39.278 --> 01:04:41.063
[both gasp]


01:04:41.237 --> 01:04:42.891
[all groaning]


01:04:43.065 --> 01:04:45.110
Can you move?No, not at all.


01:04:45.284 --> 01:04:47.721
Tails, can you?No, I'’m stuck.


01:04:47.896 --> 01:04:49.288
We might be here a while.


01:04:49.462 --> 01:04:51.464
[growls, grunts]


01:04:51.638 --> 01:04:53.902
Whoa! Whoa. Whoa. Whoa.


01:04:54.903 --> 01:04:56.339
Where'’s the key?


01:05:02.258 --> 01:05:03.476
Whoa!


01:05:03.650 --> 01:05:06.305
What was that?We might have a problem.


01:05:07.959 --> 01:05:09.918
[grunts] No, no, no, no!


01:05:11.093 --> 01:05:13.573
[grunting]


01:05:17.577 --> 01:05:19.188
[exclaims]


01:05:20.102 --> 01:05:21.190
[huffs]


01:05:30.634 --> 01:05:32.723
I'’m moving.


01:05:33.506 --> 01:05:35.117
I'’m moving!


01:05:38.294 --> 01:05:40.731
You go get it, grandson!


01:05:41.471 --> 01:05:42.515
Hey!


01:05:42.689 --> 01:05:44.517
Oh, whoa, whoa...


01:05:47.042 --> 01:05:48.913
No. No, no!


01:05:49.522 --> 01:05:51.220
I'’m almost there!


01:05:54.049 --> 01:05:54.832
Whoa!


01:05:55.006 --> 01:05:56.399
[groaning]


01:06:00.011 --> 01:06:01.578
Sonic!


01:06:08.019 --> 01:06:10.717
[gasps][all yelling, grunting]


01:06:10.891 --> 01:06:11.762
[heavy grunt]


01:06:13.155 --> 01:06:14.460
[yells]


01:06:14.634 --> 01:06:16.985
That was so not worth it!


01:06:17.986 --> 01:06:19.117
Ooh!


01:06:22.251 --> 01:06:23.992
You okay?Yeah. You good?


01:06:24.166 --> 01:06:24.905
Sonic!


01:06:25.080 --> 01:06:26.907
[Tom] Hey.[groaning]


01:06:27.082 --> 01:06:30.302
Sonic, one,
concrete boulder, zero.


01:06:30.476 --> 01:06:31.434
[sighing]


01:06:31.608 --> 01:06:32.913
Thanks for the save.


01:06:33.088 --> 01:06:34.611
Cutting it a little close,
don'’t you think?


01:06:36.047 --> 01:06:37.396
Secure the room!


01:06:39.398 --> 01:06:40.617
She'’s got the key.


01:06:43.359 --> 01:06:44.447
I got an idea.


01:06:53.673 --> 01:06:55.110
Commander Walters.


01:06:55.284 --> 01:06:56.372
Sir.


01:06:56.546 --> 01:06:58.156
You'’re...Still alive?


01:06:58.330 --> 01:07:01.116
I'’ll die before I let that key
fall into the wrong hands.


01:07:01.986 --> 01:07:03.379
Thanks for keeping it safe.


01:07:03.553 --> 01:07:05.033
I'’ll take it from here.


01:07:07.731 --> 01:07:09.559
That'’s an order,
Director Rockwell.


01:07:13.258 --> 01:07:15.913
Now, organize
the reinforcements.


01:07:17.262 --> 01:07:18.350
Yes, sir.


01:07:24.095 --> 01:07:26.315
Guys, guys, I got the key.
I repeat, I got the key.


01:07:26.489 --> 01:07:28.099
Now let'’s get out of here.


01:07:32.321 --> 01:07:34.584
Commander Walters.


01:07:34.758 --> 01:07:36.455
No, no. No. Wait!


01:07:50.730 --> 01:07:52.167
What?


01:07:52.341 --> 01:07:54.865
Tom! Everyone'’s clear!
Come on, let'’s go!


01:07:55.039 --> 01:07:56.910
You. What are you--


01:07:58.608 --> 01:07:59.652
Tom!


01:08:00.784 --> 01:08:02.829
Tom. Tom, what happened?


01:08:03.003 --> 01:08:04.527
Speak to me. Come on.


01:08:04.701 --> 01:08:06.877
Come on,
it'’s gonna be okay.


01:08:07.051 --> 01:08:10.098
Please, please, please get up.
Hey, come on, please wake up.


01:08:10.272 --> 01:08:11.882
Wake up, wake up, come on.


01:08:12.578 --> 01:08:13.971
Wake up, wake up, wake up!


01:08:14.667 --> 01:08:16.104
Maria.


01:08:20.151 --> 01:08:21.848
What did you do?


01:08:24.068 --> 01:08:26.114
What I had to.


01:08:28.768 --> 01:08:30.466
Oh, my God. Tom!


01:08:33.686 --> 01:08:35.384
Help me up, kid.


01:08:35.558 --> 01:08:37.125
[grunting]


01:08:38.213 --> 01:08:39.518
Freeze! Don'’t move!


01:08:39.692 --> 01:08:44.567
Any tricks up your sleeve,
Captain Grandtastic?


01:08:44.741 --> 01:08:46.177
[soldiers grunting]


01:08:48.397 --> 01:08:49.615
[terrified yelp]


01:08:51.313 --> 01:08:53.358
We got what we came for.


01:08:54.098 --> 01:08:56.970
Great job, Shadow.


01:08:57.710 --> 01:09:00.583
We have both keys.


01:09:00.757 --> 01:09:03.542
So where'’s your little
science project?


01:09:04.935 --> 01:09:08.895
It'’s closer than you think,
my boy.


01:09:11.071 --> 01:09:12.595
Welcome...[yelps]


01:09:12.769 --> 01:09:16.120
...to my masterpiece!


01:09:19.036 --> 01:09:20.777
I must hand it to GUN.


01:09:20.951 --> 01:09:24.389
They built her
to my exact specifications.


01:09:24.563 --> 01:09:25.738
It'’s...


01:09:27.392 --> 01:09:28.959
remarkable!


01:09:29.133 --> 01:09:30.352
Mm-hmm.


01:09:30.526 --> 01:09:33.355
Astounding!Yes.


01:09:34.486 --> 01:09:36.619
That'’s my genius grand-genome!


01:09:36.793 --> 01:09:40.405
And I have one more surprise.


01:09:42.886 --> 01:09:46.890
It'’s a new suit!


01:09:50.633 --> 01:09:52.548
[giddy squealing]


01:09:54.114 --> 01:09:56.291
[excited grunting]


01:09:56.465 --> 01:09:57.292
Gee.


01:09:57.466 --> 01:09:59.076
[smooching]


01:09:59.772 --> 01:10:01.818
[grunting]


01:10:16.833 --> 01:10:19.227
♪ <i>I'’m a chip</i>
<i>Off the old block</i>♪


01:10:19.401 --> 01:10:21.490
♪ <i>I'’m a chip</i>
<i>Off the old block</i>♪


01:10:21.664 --> 01:10:24.449
♪ <i>I'’m a chip off</i>
<i>The old block!</i>♪


01:10:24.623 --> 01:10:25.929
[ring tone chiming]


01:10:26.103 --> 01:10:28.018
What do you want, Stone?
I'’m busy.


01:10:28.192 --> 01:10:31.195
Doctor, I have a bad feeling
about this.


01:10:31.369 --> 01:10:34.329
I don'’t think your grandfather'’s
been completely honest with us.


01:10:34.503 --> 01:10:36.200
It was something Shadow said.


01:10:36.983 --> 01:10:38.202
<i>There'’s more to their plan.</i>


01:10:39.638 --> 01:10:42.685
How dare you!


01:10:42.859 --> 01:10:45.644
You have been jealous
of my long-lost grand-Pop-Tart


01:10:45.818 --> 01:10:47.951
since the very beginning!


01:10:48.125 --> 01:10:50.780
I no longer require
your obsequious groveling.


01:10:50.954 --> 01:10:53.435
<i>Consider this your notice</i>
<i>of termination.</i>


01:10:53.609 --> 01:10:57.003
Your letter of reference
will be L for Loser.


01:10:57.177 --> 01:10:59.005
Of course,
I'’ll expect you to stay on


01:10:59.179 --> 01:11:00.659
until you'’ve been
successfully cloned.


01:11:00.833 --> 01:11:04.315
But you and I are done!


01:11:04.489 --> 01:11:06.926
Like a blackened
catfish dinner!


01:11:07.100 --> 01:11:10.365
Sir, it'’s too dangerous and
I'’m not there to protect you.


01:11:10.539 --> 01:11:11.670
I already lost you once! I--


01:11:11.844 --> 01:11:13.977
Unsubscribe.
Blocked and reported.


01:11:15.195 --> 01:11:17.110
[breath shaking]
I can'’t lose you again.


01:11:19.025 --> 01:11:20.636
[sighs]


01:11:23.552 --> 01:11:25.118
Do the honors...


01:11:25.858 --> 01:11:27.033
grandson.


01:11:28.948 --> 01:11:30.254
Here we go.


01:11:56.585 --> 01:11:58.761
[excited chatter]


01:12:33.448 --> 01:12:36.494
[sirens wailing][indistinct radio chatter]


01:12:56.340 --> 01:12:58.516
[siren wails]


01:13:04.522 --> 01:13:06.263
It'’ll be okay, Sonic.


01:13:06.437 --> 01:13:08.091
It'’ll be okay?


01:13:08.265 --> 01:13:10.789
Tom is fighting for his life
and you think it'’ll be okay?


01:13:10.963 --> 01:13:14.184
The fox is simply trying
to comfort you.


01:13:14.358 --> 01:13:16.229
Comfort'’s not
what I need right now.


01:13:16.404 --> 01:13:19.537
I need to stop them.
By any means necessary.


01:13:19.711 --> 01:13:20.886
Wait, you don'’t mean--


01:13:21.060 --> 01:13:23.149
The Master Emerald.


01:13:23.323 --> 01:13:26.501
The Emerald must never be
wielded for vengeance.


01:13:26.675 --> 01:13:27.719
Not ever!


01:13:27.893 --> 01:13:29.547
We swore a sacred oath.


01:13:29.721 --> 01:13:31.680
Don'’t talk to me about oaths.
Not now!


01:13:31.854 --> 01:13:33.725
But you told Tom
using the Emerald


01:13:33.899 --> 01:13:35.335
wasn'’t the right choice.


01:13:35.510 --> 01:13:37.599
Well, now it'’s the only choice.


01:13:37.773 --> 01:13:39.557
And if neither of you
have the guts to help me,


01:13:39.731 --> 01:13:41.167
then I'’ll do it alone.


01:13:41.341 --> 01:13:43.431
But I thought
the three of us were a team.


01:13:43.605 --> 01:13:45.607
I thought that'’s what
made us special.


01:13:45.781 --> 01:13:47.565
I'’m not asking you twice,
Knuckles.


01:13:48.436 --> 01:13:51.264
Where is the Master Emerald?


01:13:53.005 --> 01:13:56.356
Your heart is being consumed
by anger, hedgehog.


01:13:56.531 --> 01:13:59.577
You are in no condition
to make decisions right now.


01:13:59.751 --> 01:14:02.319
I know you'’re upset about Tom.
We all are.


01:14:02.493 --> 01:14:04.190
Last chance.


01:14:04.364 --> 01:14:06.976
Where... is it?


01:14:07.542 --> 01:14:09.065
Don'’t do this.


01:14:15.724 --> 01:14:18.683
Part of our oath
is to trust each other.


01:14:18.857 --> 01:14:21.077
And I must abide
by that promise,


01:14:21.251 --> 01:14:23.558
even if you have chosen
to break it.


01:14:23.732 --> 01:14:25.473
But heed this warning:


01:14:25.647 --> 01:14:28.998
The Master Emerald is guarded
by a fearsome warrior.


01:14:29.172 --> 01:14:31.348
And to seize
this ultimate power,


01:14:31.522 --> 01:14:33.437
you will have to go...


01:14:33.611 --> 01:14:35.657
through him.


01:14:35.831 --> 01:14:36.962
[exhales deeply]


01:14:37.136 --> 01:14:39.748
Okay, Wade...
all comes down to this.


01:14:40.488 --> 01:14:42.141
Last few seconds.


01:14:42.315 --> 01:14:43.447
Whipple down the ice.


01:14:43.621 --> 01:14:47.146
He shoots... he scores!


01:14:47.320 --> 01:14:50.367
Wade Whipple
is a champion again!


01:14:50.541 --> 01:14:51.716
[cackles]


01:14:56.286 --> 01:14:59.463
Oh, hey, Sonic. See my goal?
Pretty sick, right?


01:14:59.637 --> 01:15:01.465
I'’m here for the Emerald.


01:15:01.639 --> 01:15:03.162
Look, Sonic, I'’m sorry.


01:15:03.336 --> 01:15:05.513
I promised to guard this emerald
with my life.


01:15:05.687 --> 01:15:07.515
I will do whatever it takes--


01:15:08.646 --> 01:15:09.734
Well, I tried.


01:15:11.649 --> 01:15:13.869
[thunder rumbling]


01:15:15.174 --> 01:15:16.175
[Wade] Sonic!


01:15:20.092 --> 01:15:21.093
Too bright!


01:15:24.706 --> 01:15:27.752
[woman] <i>This is an urgent </i>
<i>national emergency broadcast.</i>


01:15:27.926 --> 01:15:30.363
<i>A spacecraft designed</i>
<i>by the agency GUN</i>


01:15:30.538 --> 01:15:33.453
<i>has been hijacked and launched </i>
<i>out of the River Thames.</i>


01:15:33.628 --> 01:15:37.240
[man broadcasting in Japanese]


01:15:39.242 --> 01:15:42.288
[man] <i>All residents are urged </i>
<i>to seek immediate shelter.</i>


01:16:04.354 --> 01:16:06.617
[Gerald] It'’s time, Shadow.


01:16:08.271 --> 01:16:12.362
Professor, is this really
what Maria would have wanted?


01:16:15.147 --> 01:16:18.498
The question isn'’t
what Maria would have wanted.


01:16:19.630 --> 01:16:21.632
It'’s what do they deserve.


01:16:22.633 --> 01:16:25.114
Remember what she meant to us.


01:16:26.985 --> 01:16:29.901
Remember what they took from us.


01:16:40.346 --> 01:16:41.391
[Gerald] Kids!


01:16:41.565 --> 01:16:43.480
We have to go, now!


01:16:43.654 --> 01:16:45.264
[Maria panting]


01:16:48.703 --> 01:16:51.140
[Gerald] They want to take
Shadow away from us, Maria!


01:16:55.971 --> 01:16:57.146
[weapons charging]


01:16:59.757 --> 01:17:02.455
Hey! Hey! What are you doing?
Those are children.


01:17:02.630 --> 01:17:04.414
We'’ve got our orders, Walters!Stand down!


01:17:06.068 --> 01:17:07.939
[gasps]


01:17:15.817 --> 01:17:17.819
[muffled rumbling]


01:17:19.211 --> 01:17:20.430
[high-pitched whistling]


01:17:20.604 --> 01:17:22.345
[groaning]


01:17:28.264 --> 01:17:29.482
Huh?


01:17:31.049 --> 01:17:32.137
Maria!


01:18:05.867 --> 01:18:07.259
[angry roar]


01:18:07.912 --> 01:18:09.697
[panting heavily]


01:18:19.619 --> 01:18:22.622
Excuse me,
Grand Paso Doble.


01:18:22.797 --> 01:18:25.756
What is that thermonuclear
gerbil doing?


01:18:25.930 --> 01:18:28.280
[Gerald] Infusing the core...


01:18:28.454 --> 01:18:29.934
with chaos energy.


01:18:30.108 --> 01:18:32.720
That'’s my little secret.


01:18:32.894 --> 01:18:35.505
The Eclipse Cannon
is about to turn this planet


01:18:35.679 --> 01:18:38.464
into a flaming pile
of rubble,


01:18:38.638 --> 01:18:43.469
wiping out everything
in a 25,000-mile radius.


01:18:46.646 --> 01:18:48.823
Including us.


01:18:52.740 --> 01:18:54.002
What?


01:18:54.916 --> 01:18:58.006
We can'’t annihilate
the Earth!


01:18:58.180 --> 01:19:02.619
Hmm?By combining our genius,
we can rule humanity.


01:19:02.793 --> 01:19:03.707
Together!


01:19:03.881 --> 01:19:06.971
Humanity is a failed experiment.


01:19:07.145 --> 01:19:09.365
If anyone should know that,
it'’s you.


01:19:11.106 --> 01:19:14.022
All your life, you'’ve been
rejected by this world.


01:19:14.892 --> 01:19:16.546
You have nothing down there.


01:19:18.156 --> 01:19:20.202
No one who cares about you.


01:19:21.986 --> 01:19:23.553
But I have you now.


01:19:26.251 --> 01:19:27.644
We'’re family.


01:19:28.558 --> 01:19:30.168
We have each other.


01:19:31.648 --> 01:19:32.910
Oh, Ivo...


01:19:34.738 --> 01:19:36.435
you'’re no Maria.


01:19:39.787 --> 01:19:43.747
The moment I lost her,
my family was gone forever!


01:19:45.401 --> 01:19:47.142
The only way
to give Maria'’s life meaning


01:19:47.316 --> 01:19:49.579
is to destroy the world
that took her from me.


01:19:50.449 --> 01:19:52.582
So I'’m burning it all down!


01:19:55.280 --> 01:19:56.455
It'’s done.


01:19:56.629 --> 01:19:58.936
Good work, Shadow.


01:19:59.110 --> 01:20:00.982
I'’m prepping
the firing sequence.


01:20:01.156 --> 01:20:05.029
The weapon will be fully charged
in ten minutes.


01:20:08.990 --> 01:20:11.079
It'’s almost finished, Maria.


01:20:11.993 --> 01:20:14.343
You will have justice.


01:20:14.517 --> 01:20:16.127
[muffled, distant boom]


01:20:18.738 --> 01:20:20.044
What is that?


01:20:20.958 --> 01:20:23.918
Is GUN launching
missiles at us?


01:20:24.092 --> 01:20:27.138
Impossible.
It'’s moving too fast.


01:20:30.359 --> 01:20:31.882
It'’s him.


01:20:36.234 --> 01:20:37.540
[wind whistling]


01:20:37.714 --> 01:20:39.194
[both grunting]


01:20:40.369 --> 01:20:44.677
You hurt my family.
This ends now!


01:20:44.852 --> 01:20:46.549
Now you know my anger.


01:20:46.723 --> 01:20:49.595
The pain I'’ve felt
for 50 years.


01:20:49.769 --> 01:20:53.034
And you'’ve made
the same choice I did.


01:20:53.208 --> 01:20:54.774
I'’m nothing like you!


01:20:54.949 --> 01:20:56.037
We'’ll see.


01:20:56.211 --> 01:20:58.648
[both yelling]


01:21:03.871 --> 01:21:05.481
Show yourself, coward!


01:21:06.699 --> 01:21:07.875
[grunts]


01:21:09.615 --> 01:21:10.703
[grunts]


01:21:11.530 --> 01:21:12.488
[gasps]


01:21:21.453 --> 01:21:23.673
[screams]


01:21:34.466 --> 01:21:35.728
[shouts]


01:21:35.903 --> 01:21:37.121
[thunder reverberating]


01:21:37.295 --> 01:21:38.949
You were right about one thing.


01:21:39.123 --> 01:21:40.168
[straining]


01:21:40.820 --> 01:21:43.171
This ends now.


01:21:43.867 --> 01:21:46.391
[both grunting]


01:22:09.762 --> 01:22:10.807
What'’s happening?


01:22:10.981 --> 01:22:12.113
Where are they?


01:22:13.157 --> 01:22:14.419
Up there.Where?


01:22:14.593 --> 01:22:15.507
Higher.Hmm?


01:22:15.681 --> 01:22:17.074
[shocked gagging]


01:22:17.248 --> 01:22:18.510
Left yourself open.


01:22:18.684 --> 01:22:20.469
Ivo! What are you doing?


01:22:20.643 --> 01:22:22.036
Thwarting your evil plan!


01:22:28.607 --> 01:22:30.522
[both howling in pain]


01:22:32.960 --> 01:22:34.918
Not the mustache!Agreed.


01:22:35.092 --> 01:22:37.790
Let go on three.
One, two, three!


01:22:38.574 --> 01:22:40.054
[whiskers flapping]


01:22:40.228 --> 01:22:41.403
[beeps]


01:22:42.970 --> 01:22:46.234
[mocking]
Oh... a nano-fist.


01:22:46.408 --> 01:22:50.107
I haven'’t seen that
since I hate-watched <i>Green Lantern</i>in 2011.


01:22:50.281 --> 01:22:52.240
I was saving it for Comic-Con.


01:22:52.414 --> 01:22:54.459
But now there won'’t
be a Comic-Con!


01:22:54.633 --> 01:22:55.678
[yells]


01:22:58.376 --> 01:22:59.987
[both grunting]


01:23:08.125 --> 01:23:10.345
[dust settling]


01:23:17.091 --> 01:23:20.137
Why are you alone?
Where are your friends?


01:23:20.311 --> 01:23:21.834
[straining]


01:23:22.009 --> 01:23:24.402
They tried to stop you,
didn'’t they?


01:23:24.576 --> 01:23:26.056
But you came anyway.


01:23:26.230 --> 01:23:28.667
Your anger was too much.


01:23:28.841 --> 01:23:31.583
What kind of hero
abandons his friends


01:23:31.757 --> 01:23:33.803
to pursue revenge?


01:23:33.977 --> 01:23:36.284
Abandons his family!


01:23:36.458 --> 01:23:39.069
Don'’t you dare talk
about my family.


01:23:39.243 --> 01:23:41.985
And here I thought
you cared for them.


01:23:42.159 --> 01:23:45.293
Especially the one...
What'’s his name?


01:23:45.467 --> 01:23:46.685
Tom?


01:23:46.859 --> 01:23:48.861
[angry howl]


01:24:07.184 --> 01:24:08.881
[Sonic yelling][gasps]


01:24:10.796 --> 01:24:12.885
[strained panting]


01:24:13.060 --> 01:24:15.453
Go ahead. Finish it!


01:24:17.151 --> 01:24:19.501
What are you waiting for? Do it!


01:24:19.675 --> 01:24:22.243
[grunting]I'’m right here!


01:24:23.418 --> 01:24:25.550
You didn'’t let your pain
change who you are...


01:24:26.986 --> 01:24:28.031
in here.


01:24:30.120 --> 01:24:31.904
[whimpering sigh]


01:24:36.474 --> 01:24:38.433
This is not who I am.


01:24:39.129 --> 01:24:40.783
What are you doing?


01:24:40.957 --> 01:24:43.829
You won. Take your revenge.


01:24:45.701 --> 01:24:47.833
There are no winners
with revenge.


01:25:01.151 --> 01:25:02.892
[Maria] <i>Wow.</i>


01:25:03.066 --> 01:25:04.502
[voice echoing]
Look at all those stars.


01:25:05.982 --> 01:25:07.592
<i>They'’re like diamonds.</i>


01:25:09.855 --> 01:25:13.207
The last time I sat
beneath stars like this...


01:25:15.209 --> 01:25:16.775
I was with her.


01:25:18.342 --> 01:25:20.866
I'’ve felt this pain for so long.


01:25:22.564 --> 01:25:24.261
It'’s all I know.


01:25:24.435 --> 01:25:26.655
When I lost Longclaw...


01:25:26.829 --> 01:25:28.526
I felt the same way.


01:25:30.311 --> 01:25:32.748
Did your pain eventually
go away?


01:25:32.922 --> 01:25:34.880
No.


01:25:35.054 --> 01:25:36.969
But in time,
I learned there'’s something


01:25:37.144 --> 01:25:39.450
even more powerful than pain.


01:25:39.624 --> 01:25:41.713
The love we felt for each other.


01:25:42.932 --> 01:25:44.760
That'’s what you need
to hold on to, Shadow.


01:25:44.934 --> 01:25:47.154
Maria might be gone,


01:25:47.328 --> 01:25:49.330
but your love
will always remain.


01:26:03.996 --> 01:26:08.000
"The light shines
even though the star is gone."


01:26:13.092 --> 01:26:15.007
[cannon rumbling in distance]


01:26:19.838 --> 01:26:21.753
This whole mess
is my fault.


01:26:21.927 --> 01:26:24.756
I'’ve been so blinded by rage,
I thought...


01:26:25.453 --> 01:26:27.237
I had no choice.


01:26:30.762 --> 01:26:33.156
You always have a choice.


01:26:38.117 --> 01:26:40.859
But making the right one
is never easy.


01:26:41.033 --> 01:26:42.731
One more thing I learned


01:26:42.905 --> 01:26:45.690
is that when you
really screw something up,


01:26:45.864 --> 01:26:47.344
you can'’t fix it
on your own.


01:26:47.518 --> 01:26:49.738
["Live and Learn"
by Crush 40 playing]


01:27:02.533 --> 01:27:04.187
Gotta go fast.


01:27:04.361 --> 01:27:06.711
Don'’t tell me you'’ve
got a catchphrase.


01:27:06.885 --> 01:27:10.237
That'’s right, new hedgehog.
And everyone loves it.


01:27:25.991 --> 01:27:29.168
I... will... not... try...[grunting]


01:27:29.343 --> 01:27:32.302
...to stop... my...
elders... from...


01:27:32.476 --> 01:27:34.870
destroying... the... world!


01:27:35.697 --> 01:27:36.915
[screams]


01:27:40.528 --> 01:27:42.443
Playtime is over.


01:27:51.147 --> 01:27:53.367
There'’s no going back now.


01:27:53.541 --> 01:27:56.500
[wheezing grunts]


01:27:57.545 --> 01:27:59.895
Set up defense.


01:28:01.853 --> 01:28:03.159
Damn you, autocorrect!


01:28:03.333 --> 01:28:04.595
[attacking grunt]


01:28:07.250 --> 01:28:08.338
[shouts]


01:28:09.034 --> 01:28:10.079
Mantis!


01:28:12.037 --> 01:28:13.300
Oh!


01:28:15.389 --> 01:28:16.520
[cackles]


01:28:16.694 --> 01:28:17.782
Whee!


01:28:18.566 --> 01:28:19.697
[hissing growl]


01:28:19.871 --> 01:28:22.483
I'’m right here,
arach-nerd.


01:28:23.222 --> 01:28:24.049
[shouts]


01:28:24.223 --> 01:28:26.965
[both grunting]


01:28:29.664 --> 01:28:32.797
[cackles]


01:28:32.971 --> 01:28:35.713
That'’s what I call
mantis-scaping.


01:28:35.887 --> 01:28:38.325
That'’s elder abuse!


01:28:41.937 --> 01:28:44.243
[exclaims]


01:28:44.418 --> 01:28:47.638
[female computer voice]
<i>Alert! Alert! Alert!</i>


01:28:47.812 --> 01:28:49.205
Shadow...


01:28:49.379 --> 01:28:51.990
I see you'’ve chosen betrayal.


01:28:53.165 --> 01:28:55.820
And you were once
so useful to me.


01:29:11.532 --> 01:29:13.708
Ready to recycle
some tin cans?


01:29:13.882 --> 01:29:15.492
Just try to keep up.


01:29:46.784 --> 01:29:48.177
[Robotnik]
Please, Grampsy,


01:29:48.351 --> 01:29:50.092
don'’t do this!


01:29:50.266 --> 01:29:52.355
Sorry, kiddo.


01:29:52.529 --> 01:29:55.750
Bring Your Grandkid to Work Day
is over.


01:29:55.924 --> 01:29:56.968
[device beeping]


01:29:57.142 --> 01:29:59.231
[air whistling]


01:29:59.406 --> 01:30:01.756
[yelping]


01:30:01.930 --> 01:30:03.714
Any last words?


01:30:03.888 --> 01:30:06.587
Just one thing...


01:30:07.588 --> 01:30:09.677
that I never thought I'’d say.


01:30:09.851 --> 01:30:11.330
What is it?


01:30:11.505 --> 01:30:13.985
"I love you"?


01:30:14.638 --> 01:30:15.944
No.


01:30:16.118 --> 01:30:18.033
It was something even better.


01:30:18.207 --> 01:30:20.296
But I'’m not gonna say it
if that'’s the way you'’re gonna be.


01:30:20.470 --> 01:30:22.429
Okay. Bye.


01:30:23.430 --> 01:30:25.432
[screaming]


01:30:29.740 --> 01:30:32.047
[cackling]


01:30:32.221 --> 01:30:33.178
[hissing inhale]


01:30:33.352 --> 01:30:34.397
[happy grunt]


01:30:35.311 --> 01:30:37.182
Grandchildren.


01:30:37.356 --> 01:30:40.969
All the fun
and none of the responsibility.


01:30:43.101 --> 01:30:45.887
Who said life was pointless?


01:30:46.670 --> 01:30:49.586
Huh?Oh, right. You did.


01:30:49.760 --> 01:30:50.935
[growls][electricity buzzes]


01:30:51.109 --> 01:30:52.720
[screams]


01:30:53.938 --> 01:30:55.244
[faint zap]


01:30:55.418 --> 01:30:56.941
[Tails, Knuckles cheering][Knuckles] Victory!


01:30:57.115 --> 01:30:59.466
Say what you want
about my granddad,


01:30:59.640 --> 01:31:01.468
he made one
hell of a bug zapper.


01:31:02.294 --> 01:31:03.513
[groans softly]


01:31:03.687 --> 01:31:05.515
We got to stop that laser!


01:31:05.689 --> 01:31:07.909
I knew there was something
I was forgetting.


01:31:18.485 --> 01:31:21.662
We'’re out of time.
The cannon is about to fire!


01:31:21.836 --> 01:31:23.054
Where are you?


01:31:23.228 --> 01:31:25.753
Oh, you know,
just making friends.


01:31:25.927 --> 01:31:27.624
They'’re all yours.


01:31:31.236 --> 01:31:32.890
[laughing]


01:31:36.328 --> 01:31:37.852
[Sonic] Follow me!


01:31:43.945 --> 01:31:46.513
Now, this might hurt a little!


01:31:47.731 --> 01:31:49.951
[all exclaiming]


01:32:00.352 --> 01:32:03.138
So this was your plan?


01:32:03.312 --> 01:32:04.835
[straining] Yeah...


01:32:05.009 --> 01:32:08.491
Would someone mind
shutting down the giant death ray?


01:32:10.928 --> 01:32:12.756
We can'’t stop the cannon
from firing...


01:32:12.930 --> 01:32:15.019
But we can steer it away
from the Earth.


01:32:15.193 --> 01:32:17.544
Coming around to starboard.Aye-aye, Doc.


01:32:21.504 --> 01:32:23.550
Here we go.


01:32:24.768 --> 01:32:26.596
[Tails grunting][Robotnik] It'’s a little tight.


01:32:27.379 --> 01:32:29.599
Definitely not power steering.


01:32:35.518 --> 01:32:38.434
Keep... turning.[straining]


01:32:41.045 --> 01:32:42.873
Jump in anytime here, guys!


01:32:43.047 --> 01:32:44.179
[all straining]


01:32:44.353 --> 01:32:45.833
[steady beeping]


01:32:48.531 --> 01:32:52.361
Can'’t... hold... much... longer.


01:32:52.535 --> 01:32:54.493
[all yelling]


01:32:56.408 --> 01:32:58.236
[exhausted groan]


01:33:01.675 --> 01:33:03.285
[groans]


01:33:09.987 --> 01:33:11.119
Yes![cheering]


01:33:11.293 --> 01:33:13.556
I did it! I did it!


01:33:16.864 --> 01:33:18.561
Oh!Ooh!


01:33:19.214 --> 01:33:20.345
Look what you did!


01:33:20.519 --> 01:33:23.131
Hey, look down there!Sonic!


01:33:29.224 --> 01:33:31.313
Oh, Knuckles,
please tell me you have a--


01:33:31.487 --> 01:33:33.184
Last one.


01:33:33.358 --> 01:33:34.751
Let'’s make it count.


01:33:37.319 --> 01:33:39.364
Ready for a little base of ball?


01:33:40.409 --> 01:33:42.019
Deep breath.


01:33:42.193 --> 01:33:44.892
One... two... three!


01:33:45.936 --> 01:33:48.417
[Knuckles grunting]


01:33:48.591 --> 01:33:49.984
[yells]


01:34:05.260 --> 01:34:06.565
[shocked yell]


01:34:06.740 --> 01:34:08.872
Really!What'’s happening?


01:34:09.046 --> 01:34:11.527
The reactor core is overloading.


01:34:11.701 --> 01:34:14.051
It'’s only a matter of time
before it blows.


01:34:14.225 --> 01:34:15.966
So what does that mean
for Earth?


01:34:16.140 --> 01:34:18.795
A radioactive atmosphere.


01:34:18.969 --> 01:34:21.450
Rain that kills the crops
and melts your flesh.


01:34:21.624 --> 01:34:22.886
Other than that...


01:34:23.060 --> 01:34:24.714
We'’re not done here!


01:34:24.888 --> 01:34:26.803
You try to stabilize
the reactor.


01:34:26.977 --> 01:34:28.196
Buy me some time.


01:34:28.370 --> 01:34:30.415
I'’ll push the station
away from Earth


01:34:30.589 --> 01:34:32.026
before it explodes.


01:34:32.200 --> 01:34:36.204
This is our last chance
to do the right thing.


01:34:37.858 --> 01:34:40.469
[in Spanish]
Go with God


01:34:40.643 --> 01:34:42.863
stinking hedgehog.


01:34:44.125 --> 01:34:46.431
[female computer voice]
<i>Core integrity failing.</i>


01:34:55.614 --> 01:34:57.268
I'’ve got you, Sonic!


01:34:59.270 --> 01:35:00.445
[gasps]


01:35:00.619 --> 01:35:02.230
[moans]


01:35:08.889 --> 01:35:10.325
[straining]


01:35:30.606 --> 01:35:34.001
[computer] <i>Initializing</i>
<i>reactor core stabilizers.</i>


01:35:52.715 --> 01:35:55.413
This is Doctor Ivo Robotnik,


01:35:55.587 --> 01:35:58.329
dedicating my final livestream


01:35:58.503 --> 01:36:01.245
to one very special henchman:


01:36:01.855 --> 01:36:03.247
<i>Agent Stone.</i>


01:36:03.421 --> 01:36:05.641
No, no. Doctor, wait!


01:36:05.815 --> 01:36:08.209
<i>If I can'’t</i>
<i>rule the world...</i>


01:36:09.210 --> 01:36:11.038
I might as well save it...


01:36:11.212 --> 01:36:14.345
for the one and only person
who ever cared about me.


01:36:14.519 --> 01:36:16.434
Don'’t do this, Doctor, please!


01:36:16.608 --> 01:36:20.221
Stone, you were more
than a sycophant to me.


01:36:23.093 --> 01:36:24.355
You were...


01:36:25.835 --> 01:36:27.358
a syco-friend.


01:36:32.929 --> 01:36:36.454
I'’ll miss your lattes
with steamed Austrian goat milk.


01:36:38.413 --> 01:36:40.284
I love the way you make '’em!


01:37:23.371 --> 01:37:27.201
So... I guess there'’s
only one thing left to say.


01:37:27.984 --> 01:37:30.421
[mimics robotic servos]


01:37:31.988 --> 01:37:33.468
It'’s been a real drag.


01:37:34.164 --> 01:37:35.644
Thanks for nothing.


01:37:47.830 --> 01:37:49.440
[birds chirping faintly]


01:37:51.399 --> 01:37:52.966
[coughing]


01:37:54.228 --> 01:37:55.403
Sonic, look.


01:38:05.630 --> 01:38:07.502
Shadow and Robotnik.


01:38:07.676 --> 01:38:09.896
They sacrificed
themselves...


01:38:10.070 --> 01:38:12.072
to save everyone.


01:38:12.811 --> 01:38:14.857
You always have a choice.


01:38:16.119 --> 01:38:18.861
Guys, I'’m really sorry
for running off like that.


01:38:19.035 --> 01:38:20.645
I shouldn'’t have
left you behind.


01:38:22.430 --> 01:38:24.040
The truth is...


01:38:24.214 --> 01:38:26.869
you'’re the best teammates
a hedgehog could ever ask for.


01:38:28.610 --> 01:38:30.438
And the best friends.


01:38:30.612 --> 01:38:32.483
Can you ever forgive me?


01:38:36.574 --> 01:38:38.359
Team Sonic?


01:38:42.450 --> 01:38:45.061
[Sonic]
How about just "team"?


01:38:53.374 --> 01:38:54.984
Goodbye, Doctor.


01:39:11.522 --> 01:39:13.829
[Sonic] Big finish.[Knuckles] Mmm!


01:39:15.352 --> 01:39:17.789
Now that'’s
what I call teamwork.


01:39:17.964 --> 01:39:19.748
Okay! It'’s ready!


01:39:19.922 --> 01:39:21.402
[munching]


01:39:21.576 --> 01:39:22.751
[gasps]


01:39:22.925 --> 01:39:24.579
Knuckles,
how could you?


01:39:24.753 --> 01:39:26.581
Gotta be faster than that!


01:39:27.495 --> 01:39:28.583
Give me a break.


01:39:28.757 --> 01:39:30.063
Still moving a little slow
over here.


01:39:30.237 --> 01:39:32.021
Donut Lord!Yay!


01:39:32.195 --> 01:39:33.718
[pained groan]


01:39:33.892 --> 01:39:36.547
Okay, Knuckles, that'’s...I am having the love.


01:39:36.721 --> 01:39:38.071
[barks]
I want the love!


01:39:38.245 --> 01:39:40.943
[Tails] Aww...Get in here, Ozzy.


01:39:41.117 --> 01:39:42.814
It'’s great
to be back together.


01:39:42.989 --> 01:39:44.816
We'’re stronger than ever.


01:39:44.991 --> 01:39:47.428
And nothing is gonna
stand in our way.


01:39:48.777 --> 01:39:52.607
Except that one piece
of unfinished business.


01:40:01.659 --> 01:40:04.662
And way out in front, to the
surprise of absolutely no one,


01:40:04.836 --> 01:40:06.012
it'’s the Blue Blur!


01:40:06.186 --> 01:40:07.926
Often imitated,
never duplicated,


01:40:08.101 --> 01:40:09.319
the one, the only...


01:40:09.493 --> 01:40:10.233
[yells]


01:40:10.407 --> 01:40:11.887
Let'’s do this!


01:40:12.061 --> 01:40:14.237
Yeah! [laughs]


01:40:14.411 --> 01:40:17.501
[yells]All right, boys,
try and keep up.


01:40:18.198 --> 01:40:20.069
[all cheering, whooping]


01:40:24.595 --> 01:40:27.598
["Run It"
by Jelly Roll playing]


01:42:13.922 --> 01:42:17.447
Sonic the Hedgehog
is Family Champion once again!


01:42:18.100 --> 01:42:19.145
Tails?


01:42:19.710 --> 01:42:21.234
Knuckles?


01:42:22.887 --> 01:42:25.847
Okay. Yeah, I overshot
the finish line.


01:42:29.764 --> 01:42:31.244
[electronic whirring]


01:42:34.769 --> 01:42:37.772
[Sonic] Okay,
so how do I get back?


01:42:40.296 --> 01:42:42.037
[weapon powering up]


01:42:42.820 --> 01:42:44.822
[beeping]


01:42:49.175 --> 01:42:50.263
[Sonic] Pro tip:


01:42:50.437 --> 01:42:51.655
If you'’re gonna take a shot


01:42:51.829 --> 01:42:53.962
at the fastest creature
in the universe...


01:42:56.312 --> 01:42:57.922
you'’d better not miss.


01:43:01.752 --> 01:43:04.364
Um... I'’m flattered
by the cosplay,


01:43:04.538 --> 01:43:06.235
but you got
a few details wrong.


01:43:06.409 --> 01:43:09.282
I can'’t blame you, though.
It'’s hard to copy perfection.


01:43:19.379 --> 01:43:21.381
That'’s a neat trick.


01:43:29.998 --> 01:43:31.217
[Sonic yelps]


01:43:33.306 --> 01:43:35.221
What? Who are you?

